# Warehouse folder (exclude completely) - be more specific to avoid matching "warehouses"
**/Warehouse/
**/*Carpet*/
**/*Store*/

# Resources folder contents (keep folder, ignore files)
Resources/*
!Resources/.gitkeep

# Docs folder contents (keep folder, ignore specific files)
docs/plan.md
docs/erd.md
docs/domain.md
!docs/.gitkeep

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
.cache/

# OS files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Setup/Configuration files (local only)
GIT_SETUP.md

# Ignore all .md files except README.md
*.md
!README.md
